    {
      "source": "Note that as of 5.0.3, the creation of the response, which may block\nintentionally, is separated from request count tracking, and this\nmethod no longer increments the count transparently. Instead\n<a href=\"#incrementAndValidate()\"><code>incrementAndValidate()</code></a> must be invoked independently.",
      "translation": "请注意，自 5.0.3 版本起，响应创建（可能故意阻塞）与请求计数跟踪已分离，此方法不再透明地增加计数。相反，必须独立调用 <a href=\"#incrementAndValidate()\"><code>incrementAndValidate()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new request expectation that should be called a number of times\nas indicated by <code>RequestCount</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新请求期望，该期望应被调用的次数由 `<code>RequestCount</code>` 指示。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a request expectation.",
      "translation": "添加请求期望。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Define the response.",
      "translation": "定义响应。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether there is a remaining count of invocations for this expectation.",
      "translation": "此期望是否还有剩余的调用次数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Increase the matched request count and check we haven't passed the max count.",
      "translation": "增加匹配请求计数，并检查是否已超过最大计数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the requirements for this request expectation have been met.",
